#! clause: E5.3
#! mode: run
#! requires: time
#! expect-out: 100
#! input: time -> 100
# `time` is a suspending capability, NOT a synchronous foreign function (S-19/D-M7-4): a clock read
# must cross the recordable boundary, or each surface would compute it off-record and replay +
# cross-surface identity break. The host's scripted resolution is the reading.
print(time())
